The csq-socks release archive bundles two csqtt clients by amurcanov
(csqtt is developed at https://github.com/Afteroid/csqttr):

  client-2.1.9  amurcanov's 2.1.9 client, unchanged.
  client-2.5.1  amurcanov's published 2.5.0 client (commit d02da9b) plus one change,
                source/02-client-uplink-pin-fix.patch: a speed fix for small UDP packets on upload
